From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Narfinger <Narfinger@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:06:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] deps: Upgrade to rustls@0.23.46 (#48910)

`rustls` yanked `0.23.45`, so this fixes `cargo-deny` errors blocking
the CI.

Testing: Dependency update do not require tests apart from successful
compilation.

Signed-off-by: Narfinger <Narfinger@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 5abd89f8ca38ba705b46dd6dea4ba7b903d30373)

----

Fork note: backport of upstream 5abd89f8ca3 (#48910), which landed after
base/2026-10-13. rustls 0.23.45 was yanked and has four advisories, so
`cargo-deny` in the Lint job failed for every pull request. The subject
drops the backticks of the upstream subject, which the stack manifest
cannot quote.
Drop at the next sync: every later base contains 5abd89f8ca3, so this
commit applies empty and becomes a `Superseded-by: 5abd89f8ca3`
placeholder (runbook decision 3).

Validation: `./mach test-tidy` on ohos-main 5ca16eccdc1 fails in `cargo-deny` with four advisories for rustls 0.23.45 and three unmaintained crates (zbus_names, zvariant, zvariant_derive), as the Lint job of every pull request does; with both backports, `cargo-deny` reports nothing. With both: `./mach clippy --locked -- -- --deny warnings`, `RUSTFLAGS="-D warnings" ./mach build --use-crown --locked --profile checked-release`, the same with `--ohos` (SDK 6.1), and `./mach test-unit --profile checked-release` (1150 tests) and `--doc` pass.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; the agent cherry-picked upstream commit 5abd89f8ca3 without changes and added the fork-style part of this message below the dashed line: fork note, Validation and these trailers)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 Cargo.lock | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 4b0ccc4889a..7004e5655fc 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -7783,9 +7783,9 @@ dependencies = [
 
 [[package]]
 name = "rustls"
-version = "0.23.45"
